# Plugin Registry Storage Directory

This directory contains the file storage for the plugin registry.

## Structure
```
storage/
├── plugins/
│   ├── {plugin-name}/
│   │   ├── v1.0.0/
│   │   │   ├── {plugin-name}.tar.gz
│   │   │   └── manifest.json
│   │   └── v1.1.0/
│   └── {another-plugin}/
├── temp/
│   └── uploads/
├── quarantine/
│   └── suspicious-files/
└── backups/
    └── {date}/
```

## Important Notes
- This directory is managed by the plugin registry
- Plugins are stored as compressed archives (.tar.gz)
- The temp directory is used for upload processing
- Quarantine directory contains files flagged by security scans
- Backups are created according to backup configuration
- Do not manually modify files in active plugin directories